WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:09.280
Hello, to encrypt and decrypt an email, go to the bottom left to Applications, Office, Evolution, then click on “New” at the top left.

00:10.340 --> 00:16.420
Enter the recipient, the subject, and the content you want to include in the email.

00:17.280 --> 00:24.620
Check that the two icons are visible. If they are not, click on the three small lines, then on Options, and enable “Sign with PGP” and “Encrypt with PGP”.

00:25.240 --> 00:28.280
Once this is done, send the email — that’s it, your message is encrypted.

00:28.280 --> 00:41.280
To decrypt an email, open the message. You will be asked for your key; insert it, click OK, enter your passphrase, and finally you will see that your email is decrypted.

